/*
 * ============================================================================
 *  SMART ENERGY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM  (ESP32 + PZEM-004T v3 + ST7735 + relay)
 * ============================================================================
 *  Libraries (Library Manager):
 *    - PZEM004Tv30            (Jakub Mandula)
 *    - Adafruit GFX Library
 *    - Adafruit ST7735 and ST7789 Library
 *  Built in to the ESP32 core: WiFi, WebServer, ESPmDNS, Preferences.
 *  (ArduinoJson and EEPROM are no longer needed.)
 *
 *  WIRING NOTES
 *    PZEM TX -> ESP32 GPIO16 (RX2)     PZEM RX -> ESP32 GPIO17 (TX2)
 *    The PZEM voltage tap and CT clamp MUST be on the SUPPLY side of the
 *    relay. Otherwise the PZEM reads 0 V when the relay is open, so the
 *    meter can never see the grid come back and theft detection can't work.
 *    TFT uses hardware SPI: SCK=18, MOSI=23, CS=5, DC=21, RST=22.
 *
 *  FIRST LOGIN:  user "admin", password "admin123"  (change it in Settings!)
 * ============================================================================
 */

